      "question": "What is the true definition of first aid?",
      "type": "featured_snippet",
      "snippet": "First aid refers to medical attention that is usually administered immediately after the injury occurs and at the location where it occurred. It often consists of a one-time, short-term treatment and requires little technology or training to administer.",
